{
  "note": "Every console line the /pipelines/ page draws. A line carries either a probe, written as fileKey::substring, proving the pinned source contains that command or prints that message; or a tool attribution, naming the third-party program whose output is shown and the pinned file that runs it. scripts/check-traces.mjs fails the build when a probe does not resolve. Nothing here is invented prose: it is either in the repository or attributed to a tool the repository calls.",
